Test to see if migrating https://github.com/discord-userdoccers/discord-userdoccers out of userdoccers is worth it

Built on mdbook.

To get started:
- install node/npm: https://docs.npmjs.com/downloading-and-installing-node-js-and-npm
- install rustup/cargo: https://rust-lang.org/tools/install/
- install mdbook: `cargo install mdbook`

Build using `npm run build` (bundles components, rebuilds preprocessors) preview using `mdbook serve`.

./assets: additional assets to include in the docs (css, js)
./preprocessors: process the markdown before rendering
./src: documentation markdown files
./src_old: old nextjs markdown files
./src-js: lit components, gets bundled into the site

Accessible on https://chloecinders.github.io/user-mdoccers/
